<%# What came back from asking for the prompt to be rebuilt. One line, because
    the reader pressed a button and wants to know whether it took — the
    consequence (one request paid in full) is already on the button's own note,
    and repeating it here would be shouting after the fact. -%>
<% case state -%>
<% when :rebuilt -%>
  <p class="usage-note">Prompt akan dibangun ulang pada pesan berikutnya — memory, skill, dan AGENTS.md yang berubah ikut masuk.</p>
<% when :busy -%>
  <p class="usage-note">Turn masih berjalan. Kirim ulang setelah selesai: prompt dibangun sebelum pesan berikutnya, bukan di tengah jawaban.</p>
<% else -%>
  <p class="usage-note">Prompt belum di-pin — pesan berikutnya memang sudah membangunnya dari yang terbaru.</p>
<% end -%>
